Package: SummarizedExperiment7
Title: An S7 Implementation of the SummarizedExperiment Data Structure
Version: 0.0.1
Authors@R: person("Vincent", "Carey", email = "stvjc@channing.harvard.edu",
    role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A from-scratch implementation of the SummarizedExperiment and
    RangedSummarizedExperiment data structures using the 'S7' object system
    rather than Bioconductor's S4 class system. The class contracts
    (constructors, accessors, validators, slicing, and combining rules)
    follow the language-agnostic 'biocspec' specification for
    SummarizedExperiment rather than the R/Bioconductor S4 source, so this
    package is conformant with that specification without necessarily
    replicating every implementation detail of the S4 original (notably,
    there is no automatic class promotion/demotion on 'rowRanges<-'; use
    'toRangedSummarizedExperiment7()' and 'toSummarizedExperiment7()'
    instead).
License: Artistic-2.0
